        "description": "__Height:__ 185 cm (6'1\")\n\nDraken is [Mikey](https://anilist.co/character/145341/Manjirou-Sano)'s best friend and one of the founders of Toman. \n\nDraken is a muscular teenager who is exceptionally tall for his age. His head is shaven on the sides and back to expose his signature dragon tattoo on his left temple. His blonde hair is long on the top of his head and kept in a neat braid. Draken is a serious teen who lives in a brothel, he does not know his biological parents and was 'taken in' by the owners of the brothel.\n\n~!His mother was a prostitute who abandoned him at birth and died when he was two years old.!~\n\n~!In the future, Draken owns a bike shop, and is a member of Brahman.!~",
