        "description": "__Height:__ 168 cm\n\nChifuyu is the vice-captain of the First Division of Tokyo Manji gang and [Baji](https://anilist.co/character/145343)'s best friend.\n\n~!He is the first one to get to know about [Takemichi](https://anilist.co/character/145342)'s time leap ability. After that, he regularly helps Takemichi to think about saving the future.!~\n\n~!Takemichi sought his help in order to team up and face Kanto Manji, the newest [Mikey](https://anilist.co/character/145341)'s gang. He also demands that their team should be called Thousand Winters. Chifuyu also made the uniforms.!~",
